      "value": "It's actually very very easy to upload item's/equipment. The item would also require you to specify the bone you want it attached to, scaled properly, rotated, positioned and textures applied properly. All this you would have to specify yourself and is exactly the same as doing it yourself anyway. And making it into an animation would be the only required step and can be done as fast as 15 seconds.",
